            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# YTDLP Glass 1.0.0

- Native Apple Silicon media downloader with a Tahoe Liquid Glass interface.
- Fixed quick-options bar, persistent download folders, and menu bar drag-and-drop downloads.
- Bundled native Apple Silicon FFmpeg/FFprobe plus YouTube and Instagram compatibility improvements.
- Signed automatic app updates through Sparkle and verified yt-dlp engine updates.
]]></description>
